msgid "与卡片 UI 的“容器”分组一致。这些卡片不改变材料结构，而是控制同一输入如何分支、 如何保持独立流程，以及何时合并输出。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Containers` group in the card picker. These cards do not "
"change the material structure. They control how one input branches, whether branch "
"workflows remain independent, and when outputs are merged."

